  "ecamoFactSpiritualShelter": "Spiritual shelter for the children of Shekinah Tabernacle",
  "ecamoFactVision": "Vision: a model society founded on the Word of God",
  "ecamoHeaderSummary": "A biblical school within Fondation Shekinah, a stronghold of education where the most fundamental spiritual, moral, and social values are taught and preserved.",
  "ecamoLabel": "ECAMO",
  "ecamoScriptureQuote": "« My people, listen to my instructions! Give ear to the words of my mouth!... »",
  "ecamoScriptureRef": "Psalm 78:1-8",
  "ecamoSectionInspiration": "Our inspiration",
  "ecamoSectionInspirationP1": "In the Old Testament, Jochebed and Amram built an \"ark\" to protect Moses from the massacre ordered by Pharaoh. In the New Testament, Joseph and Mary, divinely warned, fled to Egypt to protect the Child Jesus from the genocide planned by Herod.",
  "ecamoSectionInspirationP2": "The founding fathers of the United States, aware of the impact of God's Word in shaping human beings, placed great importance on Bible teaching in schools. This made America a great nation, producing eminent figures such as Abraham Lincoln.",
  "ecamoSectionSchool": "The Christian School Ark of Moses",
  "ecamoSectionSchoolP1": "Facing this scourge that threatens to devastate the youth of Shekinah Tabernacle, we were led to found the Christian School Ark of Moses (ECAMO) within Fondation Shekinah, to serve as a shelter for our children. The primary goal of this biblical school is to keep our children away from the polluted influence of the world, with Bible learning taking priority.",
  "ecamoSectionSchoolP2": "We understand that the Word must take charge of the child while the mind is still untainted. Thus, at the end of their studies, they will be fully formed. As magistrate or lawyer, they will know corruption goes against the Bible; as doctor, they will know voluntary abortion is murder; as public administrator, they will know theft is sin.",
  "ecamoSectionSchoolP3": "It is only such good citizens who will form a society where life is good.",
  "ecamoSectionYouthChallenge": "The challenge facing our youth",
  "ecamoSectionYouthChallengeP1": "Today, our youth have become prey for the devil who corrupts and manipulates them at will through music, obscene films, television, the internet, and especially the collapse of the school system due to the wholesale rejection of true biblical teaching.",
  "ecamoSectionYouthChallengeP2": "Juvenile delinquency is gaining ground, parents join in, churches are in the devil's pay with preachers without the Holy Spirit, and even without morals. Schools produce nothing: one enters good and leaves twice a child of hell. Our youth no longer have a worthy role model.",
  "ecamoSectionYouthChallengeP3": "This devastation is worldwide. Everywhere, people complain about the behavior of young people, fulfilling Bible prophecies about children's rebellion. What future can we expect for our society and for the youth of Shekinah Tabernacle in particular?",
  "ecamoSubtitle": "Christian School Ark of Moses",
  "ecamoTitle": "ECAMO",
