  "notreEgliseAbout": "About",
  "notreEgliseHeaderSummary": "An interdenominational assembly in Kinshasa, carrying the Message of the Hour and engaged in missionary work around the world.",
  "notreEglisePastor": "Our Pastor",
  "notreEglisePastorGreeting": "Dear brothers and sisters, may grace and peace be granted to you abundantly from God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ, our Savior and Redeemer. We greet you warmly in His Name with these words:",
  "notreEglisePastorMessage": "Pastor's message",
  "notreEglisePastorP1": "For several years, many who receive the sermons of Prophet William Marrion Branham translated into French and other languages and published by Shekinah Publications have expressed a desire to learn more about this missionary work—its foundation, operation, resources, and means.",
  "notreEglisePastorP2": "Furthermore, after sixteen years in the Lord's work, we felt in our hearts the need to share our experience in this field and to bring some comfort to all the eleventh-hour workers in the harvest, for the fulfillment of the Lord's great and final commission to His Church (Mark 16:15-16). Today, the Lord our God has laid it on our hearts to publish all these works, which we believe will be a blessing to the Bride of Christ.",
  "notreEglisePastorP3": "The Lord our God has once again shown His love to His people by accomplishing in this end time great works that no other age has known. Mysteries hidden through all ages have been revealed today and must be brought to God's people so they may be washed, purified, and prepared for the rapture (Daniel 12:4-12). This work has a twofold purpose: to share with you the work the Lord is accomplishing among us—a difficult yet wonderful work—and to lead believers to make the salvation of lost souls their chief concern.",
  "notreEglisePastorP4": "We believe the same Holy Spirit will reveal to you your share of responsibility in this great work of proclaiming the glorious Gospel, the end-time Message, to the people of our day, knowing that this is a very short age and the Lord is accomplishing a swift work.",
  "notreEglisePastorP5": "May the Lord grant you His perfect grace to grasp this vision so that together, convinced that the Message is the truth—the salvation of humanity and the Light in this time of darkness—we may feel concerned to bring it to our brothers still held captive by the enemy throughout the world in superstition, ignorance, and darkness. May we feel the urgency to unite our efforts and talents to bring the Gospel of our Lord Jesus Christ to this dying world and quickly finish the great mission He entrusted to His Church. May the Lord bless you richly.",
  "notreEglisePastorSignature": "Your servant,",
