  "plusUserManual": "User guide",
  "userManualTitle": "User guide",
  "userManualSubtitle": "Detailed guide to follow services, explore the archives, and master every feature.",
  "userManualIntroTitle": "Welcome",
  "userManualIntroBody": "Shekinah Tabernacle is the official app of Shekinah Tabernacle Assembly. It brings together live services, sermon archives, hymns, the digital library, and your downloaded media.\n\n• Six tabs at the bottom organize main navigation.\n• Five languages are available: French, English, Spanish, Portuguese, and Chinese.\n• Internet is required for streaming and downloads; only saved files play offline.\n• Open each section below for step-by-step instructions.",
  "userManualNavTitle": "Navigation",
  "userManualNavBody": "The bottom bar has six permanent tabs:\n\n• Home — dashboard, live status, announcements, and shortcuts.\n• Sermons — full archive of recorded messages.\n• Hymns — audio or video hymns.\n• Offline — files saved on your device.\n• Library — books, golden gems, and PDF publications.\n• Plus — extra content, contact, settings, and this guide.\n\nDuring a live service, a floating window can stay visible over other screens so you can keep listening while browsing.",
  "userManualHomeTitle": "Home",
  "userManualHomeBody": "The home screen gathers what you need day to day:\n\n• Header — bell (notifications), profile, menu (light/dark/system theme, language, guide).\n• Search — top bar opens global search for sermons and hymns.\n• Live banner — red and animated when a service is live; otherwise a countdown to the next one.\n• Featured — carousel of announcements and recent sermons; See all opens the dedicated page.\n• Temple Moriah — link to the rebuilding campaign.\n• Weekly schedule — upcoming services; See more opens the full timetable.\n• Important announcements — active assembly notices.\n\nPull down to refresh live status.",
  "userManualLiveTitle": "Live service",
  "userManualLiveBody": "Open the live stream from the red banner on Home.\n\nJoin the service\n• Tap the central play button to start.\n• Choose Video (Vimeo) or Audio (Shekinah radio stream).\n• Pick the available language: FR, EN, or PT depending on the feed.\n\nDuring the live\n• The LIVE badge confirms broadcasting.\n• Video: fullscreen icon; floating window to keep listening elsewhere in the app.\n• Below the video player: bar showing your watch time and total live duration.\n• Status refreshes automatically; pull down to force refresh.\n• Adjust volume with your phone hardware buttons.\n\nIf something fails\n• A clear message appears (connection or stream unavailable).\n• Tap Retry after checking your Internet.\n\nWhen offline\n• The screen shows the schedule and countdown to the next service.",
  "userManualPredicationsTitle": "Sermons",
  "userManualPredicationsBody": "The Sermons tab opens the shekinahgospel.org archives.\n\nSearch and filters\n• Search bar — title, preacher, or location (free text).\n• Year and Preacher — two filters side by side on one row.\n• More filters — service type, time (morning/evening/vigil), and location (normalized places).\n• A red badge shows active filter count; a summary appears under the button.\n• Choosing a preacher clears the year to show their full history.\n\nBrowsing\n• Tap a sermon to open its detail page.\n• Listen to audio or watch video when available.\n• Scroll to load more; pull down to refresh.\n\nOffline download\n• On the detail page: Download → audio (recommended, lighter) or video.\n• Video: prefer Data saver (720p) to limit mobile data use.\n• Share a sermon with the Share button.",
  "userManualCantiquesTitle": "Hymns",
  "userManualCantiquesBody": "The Hymns tab lists assembly hymns.\n\nSearch and filters\n• Search bar — title, category, performer, or number.\n• Format and Filter by — two dropdowns on one row (audio, video, or category).\n\nListening\n• Open a hymn to play audio or video.\n• YouTube videos use mobile-friendly quality (about 720p).\n\nDownload\n• On the detail page, save audio or video for offline playback.\n• Files appear under Offline → Hymns.\n\nPull the list down to refresh the catalog.",
  "userManualOfflineTitle": "Offline",
  "userManualOfflineBody": "The Offline tab centralizes everything you downloaded.\n\nOrganization\n• Two sections: Sermons and Hymns.\n• Each section shows file count and storage used.\n\nInside a section\n• Search bar to find a title.\n• Filters by media type (audio, video, PDF…).\n• Tap a file to play it in the built-in player.\n\nManagement\n• Delete a file from the menu or with a long press.\n• Active downloads appear in a banner at the top of the app.\n• Share app sends an invitation; Share file sends the downloaded media.\n• Open in explorer (Android) locates the file on your device.",
  "userManualLibraryTitle": "Library",
  "userManualLibraryBody": "The Library tab opens Shekinah Publications written resources.\n\nThree sections\n• Library — general messages and books.\n• Golden gems — short selections.\n• Publications — Shekinah Publications catalog.\n\nPDF reading\n• Tap a book to open it in the in-app browser.\n• Download the PDF for offline reading.\n• The built-in reader supports zoom, scrolling, in-document search, and bookmarks.\n• Downloaded PDFs are available from Offline.",
  "userManualSearchTitle": "Search",
  "userManualSearchBody": "Global search is available from the bar at the top of Home.\n\nHow it works\n• Type at least one word; search starts automatically after a short pause.\n• Sermon and hymn results appear in separate sections.\n• Tap a result to open the matching detail page.\n\nTips\n• Use preacher name, a word from the title, or a city for sermons.\n• For hymns, number or category also work.\n• Search requires an Internet connection.",
  "userManualNotificationsTitle": "Notifications, profile, and settings",
  "userManualNotificationsBody": "Notifications\n• Bell on Home → list of alerts (live, announcements, reminders).\n• Tap a notification to open the related content.\n• Mark all as read with the top button.\n\nProfile\n• Available from Home or the Plus menu.\n• Optional sign-in to personalize your account.\n• Shortcuts to the library and marriage requests.\n\nSettings (Plus menu)\n• Theme: light, dark, or automatic (system).\n• Language: French, English, Spanish, Portuguese, Chinese.\n• WhatsApp contact, privacy policy, app version.",
  "userManualPlusTitle": "Plus menu",
  "userManualPlusBody": "The Plus tab groups extra content and services:\n\n• Services — regular and special worship times.\n• Our Church — presentation, pastor, sister churches.\n• Shekinah Publications — catalog and editorial links.\n• Shekinah Foundation — missionary work.\n• ECAMO — school and training.\n• William Branham — resources about the prophet.\n• Documentary / Skits — themed videos.\n• Hymn collections — songbooks and compilations.\n• Donations — online financial support.\n• Share app — invite others to download Shekinah Tabernacle.\n• Notifications, Contact, Profile, Guide, About, Privacy, Settings.",
  "userManualTipsTitle": "Tips",
  "userManualTipsBody": "Save data\n• Prefer sermon audio: much lighter than video.\n• For video, choose Data saver (720p).\n• Download on Wi-Fi to listen or read later without using mobile data.\n\nLive\n• Audio mode uses less data than video.\n• The floating window lets you follow the service while browsing archives.\n\nComfort\n• Dark mode is easier at night; light mode during the day.\n• Change interface language without restarting the app.\n• On network errors, check your connection before retrying.",
